            <div xml:id="preface">

                <pb facs="0007" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Preface</head>
                <p>John P. Glennon supervised the preparation of this volume
                    and compiled the portion on Korea. Allen H. Kitchens and
                        Neal H. Petersen compiled the section on Indochina.</p>
                <p>Fredrick Aandahl, formerly Editor in Chief, exercised
                    general supervision over the initiation and preparation of this volume.
                        William Z. Slany, who became General Editor in 1979,
                    directed the final editing and release. Rita M. Baker and
                        Vicki L. Ettleman of the Publishing Services Division
                    performed the technical editing under the immediate supervision of
                        Margie R. Wilber. Anne K. Pond
                    prepared the index.</p>
                <p>I acknowledge the assistance of the Department of Defense, the Joint Chiefs of
                    Staff, the National Security Council, and the Central Intelligence Agency, in
                    locating various documents and assisting the process of declassification. I
                    thank those foreign governments that granted permission to publish their
                    documents.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">David F.
                        Trask</hi></signed><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Historian,
                        Office of the Historian<lb/>Bureau of Public Affairs</hi></closer>


                <xi:include href="preface-a1.xml" xpointer="preface-a1"/>
